  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKAN Coordinator Contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">-To coordinate effective and coherent joint policy, lobbying and advocacy work on the key priority aid issues which UKAN has identified (as below)
-To pool resources &amp; share expertise on aid volume and quality in making the case for more and better aid 
-To monitor current and future commitments on aid volume and effectiveness 
-To provide evidence of the impact of better aid/aid effectiveness and &apos;dispel the myths&apos; about aid</narrative>
  </description>
